const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"为什么再加入盈利与投资？",en:"Why add profitability and investment?"},body:{zh:"作者从估值关系出发，说明账面市值比之外，预期盈利与投资也可能关联平均收益。五因子模型因此加入盈利和投资组合收益。这个动机解释了变量为何值得研究，却不单独证明某一种风险或错误定价机制是所有结果的唯一原因。",en:"Valuation relations motivate looking beyond book-to-market to expected profitability and investment. The model adds portfolio returns associated with those dimensions. This rationale explains why the variables deserve attention without uniquely identifying a risk mechanism or mispricing explanation for every empirical result."},reference:{url:"https://tevgeniou.github.io/EquityRiskFactors/bibliography/FiveFactor.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：2015年期刊版，第1–3页",en:"Source: 2015 journal article, pp. 1–3"}}},{title:{zh:"因子是组合收益，不是公司评分",en:"Factors are portfolio returns, not firm scores"},body:{zh:"RMW比较盈利强与弱的分散组合收益，CMA比较投资保守与激进的组合收益，另有市场、规模和价值因子。公司盈利水平是排序特征，对RMW的回归载荷则是收益敏感度。两者有联系，但不能把会计比率直接当成因子收益或载荷。",en:"RMW contrasts diversified robust- and weak-profitability portfolios; CMA contrasts conservative and aggressive investment portfolios alongside market, size and value factors. A firm's profitability is a sorting characteristic, while its RMW loading measures return sensitivity. Neither the factor return nor its loading is simply an accounting ratio."},reference:{url:"https://tevgeniou.github.io/EquityRiskFactors/bibliography/FiveFactor.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：2015年期刊版，第3页",en:"Source: 2015 journal article, pp. 3"}}},{title:{zh:"这里的盈利分母是账面权益",en:"Operating profitability uses book equity"},body:{zh:"文中的经营盈利以收入减去销售成本、销售及管理费用和利息费用，再除以账面权益。它不同于毛利润除以总资产，也不同于销售利润率。比较另一篇论文或数据字段时，要逐项核对费用范围、分母与财政年度，不能只看“盈利能力”这个名称。",en:"Operating profitability subtracts cost of goods sold, selling and administrative expenses, and interest expense from revenue, then divides by book equity. It differs from gross profit over assets and from a sales margin. Comparing papers or fields requires the expense scope, denominator and fiscal year, not just a shared profitability label."},reference:{url:"https://tevgeniou.github.io/EquityRiskFactors/bibliography/FiveFactor.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：2015年期刊版，第3页",en:"Source: 2015 journal article, pp. 3"}}},{title:{zh:"投资增长与排序时点相互配合",en:"Investment growth needs dated accounting inputs"},body:{zh:"投资指标使用上一财政年度总资产的增量，除以前一年度总资产。组合每年六月末排序，采用此前财政年度会计资料与规定的市值时点。保留这些时点才能理解组合形成，不能把后来修订的财报当作历史排序日已经掌握的信息。",en:"Investment uses the prior fiscal year's increase in total assets divided by assets one year earlier. Portfolios are sorted at the end of June using preceding fiscal-year accounts and specified market-value dates. These conventions matter: a subsequently revised filing is not evidence of what was known on the historical sorting date."},reference:{url:"https://tevgeniou.github.io/EquityRiskFactors/bibliography/FiveFactor.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：2015年期刊版，第3页",en:"Source: 2015 journal article, pp. 3"}}},{title:{zh:"检验的对象是有意拉开差异的组合",en:"Test portfolios deliberately span characteristics"},body:{zh:"研究通过规模与账面市值比、盈利或投资的排序构造组合，观察模型能否解释平均收益差异。若因子完整捕捉预期收益，超额收益回归截距应为零。组合拟合好与这一截距条件不是同一回事，多维排序还可能带来稀疏或分散不足的问题。",en:"Size sorts combined with book-to-market, profitability or investment create test portfolios with different average returns. Complete capture of expected returns implies zero excess-return regression intercepts. Good fit is a different criterion, and multidimensional sorting can also create sparse or poorly diversified cells."},reference:{url:"https://tevgeniou.github.io/EquityRiskFactors/bibliography/FiveFactor.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：2015年期刊版，第3–4页",en:"Source: 2015 journal article, pp. 3–4"}}},{title:{zh:"冗余结论有样本边界",en:"Redundancy is a sample-dependent finding"},body:{zh:"论文的主要样本是1963年7月至2013年12月的美国股票。作者讨论加入新因子后的HML冗余，也指出低盈利且高投资的小股票带来的困难。理解这些结果要保留检验时期与组合选择，不能推导出价值永久失效或五因子普遍完备。",en:"The main US sample runs from July 1963 to December 2013. The paper discusses HML redundancy after adding the new factors and difficulties with small, weak-profitability, high-investment stocks. Neither finding establishes that value is permanently obsolete or that five factors universally complete an asset-pricing model."},reference:{url:"https://tevgeniou.github.io/EquityRiskFactors/bibliography/FiveFactor.pdf",label:{zh:"原文定位：2015年期刊版，第1–4页",en:"Source: 2015 journal article, pp. 1–4"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"五因子解释力取决于样本与检验组合。某个样本中的价值因子冗余，不代表价值特征永久无用；模型也不是个股收益承诺。",en:"Explanatory power depends on the sample and test portfolios. Value-factor redundancy in one sample does not make value characteristics permanently irrelevant or turn the model into a return promise."}};export{e as default};
